2026-07-27T14:39:52.5725584Z i /tmp/RtmpMeXiSH/duckdb
2026-07-27T14:39:52.5726093Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T14:39:52.5726696Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T14:39:52.5727220Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:39:52.5727972Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:39:52.5728787Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:39:52.5729991Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
